ted, prescribed, laid down.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Fixed, agreed upon, stipulated.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Bound, confined; ब्रह्मा येन कुलालवन्नियमितो ब्रह्माण्डभाण्डोदरे. Bh.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Observed (as a vow or penance).", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["niyamita"], "synonyms_slp1": ["niyamita"]}], "niyam": [{"id": "niyam", "headword": "नियम्", "headword_slp1": "niyam", "fold": "niyam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-sa", "senses": [{"gloss": "नियम् [niyam], 1 P.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "To restain, curb, check, control, govern; प्रकृत्या नियताः स्वया Bg.7.2; (सुतां) शशाक मेना न नियन्तुमुद्यमात् Ku.5.5; 'could not dissuade her', &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "To suppress, suspend, hold in (as breath, &c.); Ms. 2.192; न कथंचन दुर्योनिः प्रकृतिं स्वां नियच्छति Ms.1.59 'does not suppress or conceal', &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "To offer, give; को नः कुले निवपनानि नियच्छतीति Ś.6.25.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "To punish, chastise; नियन्तव्यश्च राजभिः Ms.9.213.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "To regulate or direct in general; लोको नियम्यत इवात्मदशान्तरेषु Ś.4.2.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "To attain, obtain; तालज्ञश्चाप्रयासेन मोक्षमार्गं नियच्छति Y.3.115; Ms.2.93.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "To put on, assume.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "To place upon.-Caus. (नियमयति)", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "To restrain, control, regulate, check, punish; नियमयसि विमार्गप्रस्थितानात्तदण्डः Ś.5.8.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "To bind, fasten; Śi.7.56; R.5.73.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "To moderate, lessen, mitigate, relieve; छायाद्रुमैर्नियमितार्कमयूखतापः Ś.4.11; Ku.1.6.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["niya", "niyam", "निय"], "synonyms_slp1": ["niya", "niyam", "niya"]}], "niyavaH": [{"id": "niyavaH", "headword": "नियवः", "headword_slp1": "niyavaH", "fold": "niyavaH", "headword_language": "